Moreinfo:
I'm android developer with proficiency in Java & Kotlin. Mobile technologies improve people’s lives in many different aspects nowadays and I enjoy to create things that help other people to make their life better and more comfortable.
My experience:
- development of android applications with responsive UI according to material design guidelines;
- designing the architecture of mobile apps;
- writing android applications from scratch;
- prototyping UI, implementing android layouts for various screens and devices;
- improving app performance;
- refactoring and optimizing code, supporting mobile applications;
- writing support documentation;
- testing: writing unit tests and instrumented tests for android applications;

CV:
5+ years of experience with Mobile Development and building user-facing applications on Android.
Strong knowledge of Android SDK and different versions of Android.
Strong knowledge of Google’s Android UI design principles, patterns, best practices, and interface guidelines.
Experience working with offline storage, threading, and performance tuning.
5+ years of experience with RESTful APIs that connects Android applications to back-end services.
Experience with optimizing mobile apps, in Java and Kotlin.
5+ years of successful and applicable hands-on experience in software or infrastructure development domain and principles, including design patterns and code structure.
Proficient understanding of code versioning tools, such as Git, GitHub
Ability to understand business requirements and translate them into technical requirements.
5+ years of experience with Kotlin, Kotlin flow, Kotlin Coroutines
5+ years of experience with design patterns, coding conventions, modularization
2+ year of experience coding in Java and 3+ Kotlin.
Ability to interact well in a team environment.
