Moreinfo:
A Quality Assurance Engineer with three years of experience. I have been working as a single QA with 3-5 developers for 2 years. Our team has been working on one long-term project. It's a Ukrainian web-based marketplace. Our team has been working with scrum methodology. We always discuss our goals and tasks for the sprint at innit and daily meetings.
My qualifications and responsibilities:
created test plans for new product development;
accurately monitored and recorded results in test documentation;
worked with developers to track backlog items;
investigated and reproduced problems, documented findings;
bug logged and tracked through JIRA;
assisted developers with issue analysis;
worked with functional QA & Development teams to troubleshoot and improve identified performance bottlenecks;
worked with MySQL Server;
familiar with Postman, RabbitMQ, ElasticSearch, Kibana, Graylog;
worked with different OSs: Android, iOS, MS Windows, Mac OS, Linux.

